WEBVTT

01:42.660 --> 01:44.960
Work hard, sprint fast,
a hundred days to glory.

01:45.460 --> 01:47.620
Top the honor roll,
reap your golden story!

01:48.460 --> 01:51.780
Coming to Experimental High School
feels like yesterday.

01:51.820 --> 01:52.820
KNOWLEDGE TODAY FOR CHANCES TOMORROW.
READING AVOIDS STAGNANT MINDS.

01:52.860 --> 01:53.860
Yet here we are,

01:54.360 --> 01:56.480
the college entrance exam
is calling us to graduate.

02:01.760 --> 02:04.200
Jiang Qiaoxi didn't start
preparing for his overseas exams

02:04.240 --> 02:06.240
only after returning to school.

02:07.160 --> 02:09.080
Later, I even suspected

02:09.580 --> 02:12.020
those materials his cousin mailed

02:12.060 --> 02:14.000
under the guise of Olympiad prep

02:14.040 --> 02:16.600
were probably for admission all along.

02:17.100 --> 02:19.360
Because Jiang Qiaoxi's
got too little time for prepping,

02:19.860 --> 02:22.840
yet he went straight in those tests
remarkably fast.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.980
No matter what questions I had for him,

02:28.480 --> 02:30.760
normal or weird,

02:30.800 --> 02:31.760
school-related

02:31.800 --> 02:33.320
or even manga trivia,

02:33.360 --> 02:35.000
he answered everything in a flash.

02:37.780 --> 02:39.080
I get it.

02:44.700 --> 02:48.280
Even when Qin Yeyun asked if there was any
news about actor Chen Jinhong's new films,

02:48.320 --> 02:49.640
he would go and research for it.

02:50.140 --> 02:51.600
He could've just snapped a photo

02:51.640 --> 02:52.800
and sent an email,

02:53.300 --> 02:56.140
but he'd have the mood
to buy magazines instead.

02:56.840 --> 02:59.900
Back then,
everything came so easily to him.

03:11.760 --> 03:14.960
Nothing Jiang Qiaoxi does
surprises me anymore.

03:15.880 --> 03:18.700
Back in Qunshan,
he was all clingy with us.

03:19.200 --> 03:21.660
New to Experimental High School,
he pretended not to know us.

03:22.180 --> 03:24.160
Then we got chummy again.

03:26.320 --> 03:28.280
Now he's ignoring Du Shang's messages.

03:29.860 --> 03:31.000
Listen, Lin Qile.

03:31.600 --> 03:33.660
That guy marches entirely to his own drum.

03:34.160 --> 03:35.840
He'll do exactly what he wants.

03:37.020 --> 03:39.140
You can't do anything about him.

03:39.680 --> 03:40.820
Eventually,

03:41.320 --> 03:44.080
Jiang Qiaoxi pretty much stopped
replying to other's messages.

03:44.700 --> 03:45.900
Honestly,

03:46.440 --> 03:48.140
I didn't dwell on it much.

03:51.420 --> 03:53.180
Mom certainly put a nicer spin on things.

03:53.680 --> 03:55.460
Uncle Cai told us all about Qiaoxi's

03:55.500 --> 03:57.980
exams for studying abroad,
they're ridiculously hard,

03:58.020 --> 03:59.940
covering university-level subjects

04:00.440 --> 04:01.860
like architecture

04:01.900 --> 04:05.260
and even psychology.
Really absurd courseworks.

04:05.760 --> 04:08.380
Honestly, he's probably
drowning in all that.

04:08.420 --> 04:10.080
Too overwhelmed to chat with anyone.

04:12.560 --> 04:13.400
It makes sense.

04:16.100 --> 04:17.800
- Yingtao.
- It was only later that I realized

04:17.839 --> 04:20.180
- Did your math and science scores
- Jiang Qiaoxi

04:20.220 --> 04:21.779
- drop this time?
- was drowning back then,

04:22.340 --> 04:23.880
just not in the way we assumed.

04:23.920 --> 04:26.220
Not from exam stress,

04:27.360 --> 04:28.520
but from the kind of…

04:28.560 --> 04:29.600
I've finished.

04:29.640 --> 04:31.880
grown-up chaos we couldn't yet fathom.

04:32.380 --> 04:33.360
Have you seen this?

04:33.400 --> 04:34.700
It's been falling nonstop for days.

04:34.740 --> 04:36.040
With such a steep drop,

04:36.080 --> 04:37.200
Mrs. Liang told me to sell the stocks.

04:37.240 --> 04:38.420
Something must be happening.

04:40.500 --> 04:41.420
Can't make sense of this.

04:42.120 --> 04:43.080
How much is it losing?

04:44.680 --> 04:45.540
How to put it?

04:46.040 --> 04:47.000
Let's just say

04:47.580 --> 04:48.920
she's losing one Audi car every day.

04:49.860 --> 04:50.920
That much?

04:52.760 --> 04:55.520
Why is she so urgently

04:55.560 --> 04:56.420
in need of money?

04:56.460 --> 04:57.780
Not sure, just said it's urgent.

04:57.820 --> 04:59.880
She wants to sell everything
for cash, no matter how.

05:00.640 --> 05:02.400
Could it be something
happened to Jiang Qiaoxi?

05:02.440 --> 05:03.740
I'm back.

05:04.820 --> 05:06.400
- You're back.
- What's wrong?

05:07.800 --> 05:08.720
You're back.

05:08.760 --> 05:09.660
- Uncle Cai.
- Hi.

05:10.680 --> 05:13.080
There are moths in my house again?

05:13.120 --> 05:14.260
No!

05:14.300 --> 05:16.600
He was just chatting with me,
then suddenly got nostalgic.

05:16.640 --> 05:19.800
He wanted to dig up some old photo
of you and Cai Fangyuan as kids.

05:19.840 --> 05:21.380
- Right.
- What photo?

05:21.420 --> 05:22.520
This one!

05:22.560 --> 05:23.720
- This one?
- You found it!

05:24.220 --> 05:25.560
Back then, I was so tanned.

05:25.600 --> 05:26.440
Tanned? No way.

05:26.480 --> 05:28.160
You were only this tall.
I could pick you up with one arm.

05:28.200 --> 05:29.860
Then I'll send it to you.

05:29.900 --> 05:31.440
- No need.
- Just have a look.

05:31.480 --> 05:33.460
Make a cup of tea for your uncle.

05:34.400 --> 05:35.260
I forgot just now.

05:35.760 --> 05:36.600
Okay.

05:37.680 --> 05:41.380
There's rose tea, chrysanthemum tea,
and plum wine available.

05:41.420 --> 05:43.140
Chrysanthemum tea.
No drinking in broad daylight.

05:43.180 --> 05:44.200
Chrysanthemum tea.

05:44.240 --> 05:45.240
Just a moment.

05:46.120 --> 05:47.000
You go first.

05:47.040 --> 05:47.880
Okay.

05:55.320 --> 05:56.400
Could it be something

05:57.240 --> 05:58.120
happened to Qiaoxi?

05:58.160 --> 06:00.120
Listen, it can't be Jiang Qiaoxi.

06:00.620 --> 06:02.000
If it were Qiaoxi,

06:02.040 --> 06:03.540
Mrs. Liang wouldn't be this calm.

06:03.580 --> 06:04.460
Right?

06:04.500 --> 06:05.340
Don't you think?

06:06.140 --> 06:06.980
- Uncle Cai.
- Hey, yes?

06:07.480 --> 06:10.200
Cai Fangyuan's been working
really hard lately

06:10.240 --> 06:12.180
at school and everything.

06:12.680 --> 06:16.040
So if he slacks off a bit at home,
don't scold him, okay?

06:16.080 --> 06:17.620
And don't worry about

06:17.660 --> 06:18.840
the problems he can't solve.

06:18.880 --> 06:20.400
Jiang Qiaoxi's got him covered.

06:21.400 --> 06:22.420
Sure.

06:24.420 --> 06:25.520
Because honestly,

06:25.560 --> 06:27.320
ever since Jiang Qiaoxi
moved to Hong Kong,

06:27.360 --> 06:28.720
- he's turned into a total chatterbox.
- Next one.

06:28.760 --> 06:29.600
My dream is

06:29.640 --> 06:31.680
- Even when he's sick with a cold,
- to become a firefighter.

06:31.720 --> 06:33.540
- he keeps talking nonstop.
- Wow!

06:33.580 --> 06:36.020
I just think he'd be better off

06:36.060 --> 06:37.340
speaking less

06:37.380 --> 06:38.760
and resting more.

06:39.940 --> 06:41.340
My dream is to become…

06:41.380 --> 06:44.220
Even though Jiang Qiaoxi
can't be bothered with most people,

06:44.840 --> 06:45.740
I've always

06:45.780 --> 06:48.500
- gotten the most dialogue from him.
- My dream is to become

06:48.540 --> 06:50.640
- So it never crossed my mind
- richest person

06:50.680 --> 06:52.740
- what it'd be like
- in the province.

06:52.780 --> 06:54.160
if he stopped talking to me.

06:55.220 --> 06:57.040
Who wrote it?

06:57.080 --> 07:01.560
Someone actually wrote "my dream's to
be the richest person in the province".

07:01.600 --> 07:02.960
Good lord.

07:13.060 --> 07:15.040
You can also achieve your dream.

07:32.240 --> 07:34.360
TRIUMPH IN THE REALM OF KNOWLEDGE,
JIALIN STUDENTS TO CLAIM THE LAUREL CROWN.

07:39.880 --> 07:41.560
Come on, hurry up and get off the bus!

07:42.240 --> 07:44.220
Don't forget your ID
and exam admission ticket!

08:03.340 --> 08:04.520
Jiang Qiaoxi,

08:04.560 --> 08:07.380
you promised to tell me
your grades after my exam.

08:07.880 --> 08:09.540
Why haven't you?

08:10.280 --> 08:11.360
Jiang Qiaoxi,

08:12.120 --> 08:13.720
why are you not replying?

08:14.560 --> 08:16.680
Did you go grocery shopping or what?

08:17.580 --> 08:20.240
Too bad you're not on this bus.

08:20.280 --> 08:22.640
We're taking the bus to Zhouzhou Bistro.

08:23.140 --> 08:24.520
It's so crowded this time

08:24.560 --> 08:26.360
that Uncle Cai's car couldn't fit us all.

08:26.860 --> 08:30.080
I'll definitely order
your favorite garlic spare ribs.

08:30.580 --> 08:31.420
Done! Finally.

08:31.460 --> 08:32.820
Done with the exams! Jiang Qiaoxi.

08:32.860 --> 08:34.260
Guess how I did?

08:34.299 --> 08:35.620
And you,

08:35.659 --> 08:37.059
did your high school life

08:37.100 --> 08:40.940
technically end the day you transferred
from Hongyang

08:40.980 --> 08:42.220
to Hong Kong?

08:42.260 --> 08:43.520
Just one more exam this afternoon,

08:43.559 --> 08:45.880
and my high school era is officially over.

08:46.400 --> 08:49.040
Mom's forcing fish congee on me again.

08:49.080 --> 08:50.320
I can't finish it!

08:50.360 --> 08:51.380
But she insists

08:51.420 --> 08:53.100
it boosts energy

08:53.140 --> 08:54.360
and is essential for exams.

08:54.400 --> 08:55.540
Jiang Qiaoxi,

08:55.580 --> 08:57.300
our exams end tomorrow.

08:57.340 --> 08:58.460
When are you coming back?

08:58.960 --> 09:00.540
Yu Qiao and Cai Fangyuan said

09:00.580 --> 09:02.160
they want to have a proper summer break.

09:02.660 --> 09:04.640
Will you join us?

09:08.440 --> 09:10.200
What am I singing?

09:10.240 --> 09:12.180
Everything feels right

09:12.220 --> 09:13.820
Oh, you are,

09:13.860 --> 09:15.720
you are my greatest hit

09:15.760 --> 09:17.380
- What are you saying?
- Cheers.

09:17.420 --> 09:18.540
- Even heard just once,
- Cheers.

09:18.580 --> 09:21.060
- I'll remember
- Relax.

09:21.100 --> 09:22.960
Twice, and my heart burns

09:23.000 --> 09:24.400
What am I doing?

09:24.440 --> 09:26.480
Everything feels bright

09:26.520 --> 09:28.960
Seeing you…

09:30.700 --> 09:32.320
Am I a fish?

09:50.000 --> 09:51.440
Congratulations on finishing your exams!

09:51.480 --> 09:53.680
Now go begin your university journey.

09:53.720 --> 09:55.460
Your life stretches boundless before you.

09:55.960 --> 09:57.280
Jiang Qiaoxi replied!

09:57.320 --> 09:58.200
He actually replied!

09:58.240 --> 09:59.900
Look. He texted me back.

09:59.940 --> 10:01.240
- Ask him if he wants to go out with us.
- Right.

10:02.160 --> 10:03.000
Fine.

10:03.040 --> 10:03.900
I'll call him.

10:04.440 --> 10:05.500
I'm gonna tell him

10:05.540 --> 10:07.360
we're here living large,

10:07.400 --> 10:08.820
while he's stuck there with nothing.

10:08.860 --> 10:09.720
- Don't rush!
- He don't have this in Hong Kong.

10:09.760 --> 10:11.760
You all…have your seats.

10:11.800 --> 10:13.260
Eat first.

10:13.300 --> 10:14.660
The food's getting cold, Yingtao.

10:14.700 --> 10:15.760
The food's getting cold.

10:23.340 --> 10:24.260
Hello.

10:24.300 --> 10:27.400
The subscriber you have dialed
is currently unavailable.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.660
Please try your call again later.

10:39.220 --> 10:40.220
Never mind, have some more.

10:40.260 --> 10:41.240
Eat a bit more.

10:41.780 --> 10:42.700
- Eat.
- Okay.

10:42.740 --> 10:43.780
Eat.

10:43.820 --> 10:44.920
Eat!

10:44.960 --> 10:45.860
It's okay.

10:49.060 --> 10:50.080
Jiang…

10:52.020 --> 10:53.860
Can we get you the sweet soup now?

10:53.900 --> 10:56.960
A gift of fruit-infused sweet Tangyuan
for private-room guests.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.040
Sure, we can have it now.

10:59.080 --> 10:59.920
Go ahead.

11:31.740 --> 11:33.340
- What is she taking?
- Buns.

11:35.840 --> 11:36.680
Yingtao.

11:36.720 --> 11:38.220
You didn't fill up earlier?

11:41.720 --> 11:42.560
She didn't fill up?

11:51.840 --> 11:53.200
I'm going out for a while.

11:53.240 --> 11:54.240
Huh?

12:40.820 --> 12:41.860
Yingtao,

12:41.900 --> 12:43.620
what are you doing here late at night?

12:43.660 --> 12:44.840
Come on, let's go home.

12:44.880 --> 12:46.900
- Sit for a while.
- No need, Grandma Jia.

12:47.400 --> 12:51.000
I'm waiting for Auntie Liang
and Uncle Jiang.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.200
Ah, Jiang.

12:52.700 --> 12:53.840
Their family moved away.

12:53.880 --> 12:54.720
They don't live here anymore.

12:54.760 --> 12:55.600
Moved away?

12:56.100 --> 12:57.620
What do you mean?

12:57.660 --> 12:59.700
Liang apparently went abroad for work.

12:59.740 --> 13:00.960
She said

13:01.000 --> 13:03.000
she needed to earn more.
Living costs were too high.

13:03.040 --> 13:04.900
After that, Jiang moved out too.

13:04.940 --> 13:06.160
They don't live here anymore.

13:07.400 --> 13:08.740
If they don't live here anymore,

13:09.320 --> 13:10.300
how can that be?

13:10.800 --> 13:12.240
If Jiang Qiaoxi ever comes back,

13:12.280 --> 13:13.420
he won't have a home.

13:13.460 --> 13:15.360
The house isn't sold yet.

13:15.920 --> 13:18.620
That boy Qiaoxi,
he'll come back eventually.

13:43.680 --> 13:45.880
FENG LETIAN

13:50.760 --> 13:51.800
LOADING

13:52.580 --> 13:55.040
Tomorrow I'm going to the White Villa
to sort things out.

13:55.080 --> 13:56.140
Do you want to come along?

14:05.220 --> 14:06.140
No.

14:24.580 --> 14:25.600
Yes.

14:26.620 --> 14:28.200
See you at nine tomorrow.

14:28.980 --> 14:31.160
That day, I saw you
in your cheerleader outfit,

14:31.200 --> 14:32.540
walking across the field,

14:33.040 --> 14:34.340
and I was stunned.

14:35.200 --> 14:36.260
I never expected

14:36.300 --> 14:39.120
our school to have
such a legit cheerleading squad.

14:39.620 --> 14:40.740
You didn't even look like you.

14:41.240 --> 14:43.660
But at the same time,
you were like a whole new you.

14:46.740 --> 14:48.100
Is this "new me"

14:48.600 --> 14:50.960
because of what I was wearing that day?

14:51.720 --> 14:52.560
No.

14:54.580 --> 14:57.300
Back when we were
in middle school at Qunshan,

14:57.340 --> 14:59.660
for all three years, you barely spoke.

14:59.700 --> 15:01.900
You hardly ever
joined in class activities.

15:02.400 --> 15:04.240
You left right after school.

15:04.280 --> 15:06.500
Back then,
I thought you were just introverted,

15:07.560 --> 15:08.640
always…

15:08.680 --> 15:10.220
quiet and expressionless,

15:10.260 --> 15:11.740
like Lu Xueqi.

15:12.780 --> 15:14.660
Have you been writing too many novels?

15:14.700 --> 15:16.640
You're starting to
see everyone as a character.

15:18.540 --> 15:19.520
But later

15:20.160 --> 15:21.380
I realized I was wrong.

15:21.420 --> 15:23.760
That wasn't the real you.

15:23.800 --> 15:26.160
The you at Experimental High
is the true you,

15:26.660 --> 15:29.840
or the one at Qunshan Middle School
was a new you.

15:42.920 --> 15:44.860
It doesn't feel much different

15:45.460 --> 15:47.000
from a regular classroom.

15:48.640 --> 15:50.820
Whether it's me, Jiang Qiaoxi,

15:51.320 --> 15:53.300
or anyone in this advanced class,

15:53.800 --> 15:55.780
we're no different from regular humans.

15:55.820 --> 15:57.080
Just carbon-based lifeforms.

15:59.840 --> 16:00.960
This was my seat.

16:05.680 --> 16:07.620
Didn't you finish packing already?

16:09.760 --> 16:10.860
Been done for a while.

16:19.140 --> 16:20.020
Lin Qile.

16:21.220 --> 16:22.060
What is it?

16:22.560 --> 16:23.980
Do you think I'm qualified?

16:26.560 --> 16:29.500
Qualified for what?

16:29.540 --> 16:31.620
Now that the college entrance exams
are over.

16:32.300 --> 16:33.580
We're almost university students.

16:33.620 --> 16:35.440
Throughout that final countdown,

16:35.940 --> 16:37.920
I've been keeping
another timer in my heart.

16:38.780 --> 16:39.620
I waited all this time

16:40.120 --> 16:42.620
because I wanted to tell you now,
at this very moment.

16:43.160 --> 16:45.960
I hope to be in a deeper relationship
with you, more than being classmates.

16:47.140 --> 16:48.060
Will you?

17:11.339 --> 17:12.200
Monitor.

17:13.940 --> 17:14.780
I'm sorry.

17:15.319 --> 17:16.520
Lin Qile,

17:17.440 --> 17:18.940
you've done nothing wrong.

17:19.540 --> 17:20.780
The fault is entirely mine.

17:21.640 --> 17:23.220
I knew your answer.

17:23.780 --> 17:25.099
Yet I asked anyway,

17:25.640 --> 17:26.720
forcing this burden upon you.

17:29.020 --> 17:30.040
But…

17:30.080 --> 17:31.400
you didn't come here today

17:32.580 --> 17:34.000
just to help me pack, did you?

17:35.900 --> 17:36.960
You know it.

17:37.720 --> 17:39.120
I knew it.

17:39.160 --> 17:40.700
You came to see

17:41.560 --> 17:43.480
Jiang Qiaoxi's seat, didn't you?

17:49.100 --> 17:50.380
Right over there.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.440
I always thought

18:06.960 --> 18:08.400
he'd come back

18:08.940 --> 18:10.600
for these things after May.

18:13.040 --> 18:14.320
Take his things back for him.

18:42.220 --> 18:43.460
I get it.

18:43.500 --> 18:44.420
Jiang Qiaoxi,

18:44.920 --> 18:47.360
a genius, a star who were born lucky.

18:48.500 --> 18:49.700
What do I have to compete?

18:49.740 --> 18:51.300
What could I ever win?

18:53.440 --> 18:54.660
He's no lucky star.

18:58.540 --> 18:59.820
He fought bitterly for it.

19:01.280 --> 19:03.000
Every step of the way.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.200
HALL OF KNOWLEDGE AND ACTION

19:16.240 --> 19:17.120
Is it heavy?

19:17.160 --> 19:18.440
Do you need me to carry it for you?

19:18.480 --> 19:19.840
No. I can do it myself.

19:20.380 --> 19:22.540
Yingtao, you don't need to worry so much.

19:22.580 --> 19:23.880
He'll definitely come back.

19:24.960 --> 19:27.480
A junior named Qi Le once told me

19:27.520 --> 19:29.020
how exhausting those Olympiads were,

19:29.060 --> 19:30.020
back-to-back exams.

19:30.060 --> 19:31.160
Some would leave the venue

19:31.200 --> 19:32.960
and wander outside till midnight.

19:33.000 --> 19:34.400
Others refuse to return,

19:34.440 --> 19:36.120
heading straight to
tourist spots to unwind.

19:36.620 --> 19:37.880
But not Jiang Qiaoxi.

19:37.920 --> 19:39.260
He'd only call you,

19:39.800 --> 19:40.640
rain or shine.

19:41.140 --> 19:42.940
After every exam, every single day,

19:42.980 --> 19:44.220
he'd call you,

19:44.820 --> 19:46.280
never mind who might see.

19:46.320 --> 19:48.540
That demeanor of his, how to describe it?

19:49.580 --> 19:50.680
Unrestrained.

19:50.720 --> 19:51.680
Recklessly bold.

19:54.540 --> 19:56.320
So don't you worry.

19:56.820 --> 19:58.280
Yes, he had to leave for school,

19:59.700 --> 20:01.320
but I guarantee

20:01.980 --> 20:03.180
the moment he returns,

20:03.720 --> 20:04.960
you'll be his first to find.

20:26.540 --> 20:28.600
BUILDING A BETTER POWER COMMUNITY TOGETHER

21:24.220 --> 21:25.200
I promise you

21:26.700 --> 21:27.820
and Chunlu too.

21:29.500 --> 21:30.840
I'll come home soon

22:02.200 --> 22:03.280
Jiang Qiaoxi?

22:26.760 --> 22:28.380
Are you stealing from your own family?

22:36.900 --> 22:37.740
Yingtao,

22:38.500 --> 22:39.440
what are you saying?

22:39.980 --> 22:41.340
Why are you sneaking around

22:43.060 --> 22:44.320
your own home like a thief?

22:48.100 --> 22:49.900
Are you running away again?

23:01.720 --> 23:02.760
What do you think,

23:04.580 --> 23:05.600
Yingtao?

23:06.260 --> 23:07.260
I think…

23:13.180 --> 23:14.140
I think…

23:17.900 --> 23:19.180
you're here to see me.

23:34.700 --> 23:35.580
Right.

23:36.260 --> 23:37.440
I'm not going abroad.

23:38.820 --> 23:39.880
I want to…

23:41.140 --> 23:42.140
stay right here,

23:42.720 --> 23:43.920
with you.

23:46.660 --> 23:48.000
You're not going abroad?

23:51.300 --> 23:52.680
I knew it.

23:52.720 --> 23:55.580
You wouldn't just
cut me off for no reason.

23:55.620 --> 23:57.460
You wouldn't vanish without cause.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.400
They must have cut your phone line,

23:59.440 --> 24:01.820
and my letters,
torn to pieces again, right?

24:04.320 --> 24:05.340
Jiang Qiaoxi.

24:06.720 --> 24:08.240
You'd never leave me willingly.

24:08.740 --> 24:09.580
Tell me I'm right.

24:15.120 --> 24:16.200
Of course.

24:18.540 --> 24:20.520
I've been well in Hong Kong.

24:21.480 --> 24:22.540
My cousin too.

24:23.040 --> 24:24.340
He even has a daughter now.

24:25.940 --> 24:27.740
I am also studying well

24:29.300 --> 24:30.360
in Hong Kong.

24:30.960 --> 24:31.980
You know how it is.

24:32.560 --> 24:34.920
Top marks, as always.

24:36.020 --> 24:37.620
Could've picked any university.

24:39.960 --> 24:40.860
But…

24:41.440 --> 24:42.740
I don't want any of that.

24:43.240 --> 24:44.780
Because none of those places

24:47.040 --> 24:48.480
have you, Lin Yingtao.

24:50.980 --> 24:52.600
Or Auntie's jujube buns.

24:55.620 --> 24:56.460
So I…

25:00.760 --> 25:01.780
I think I'll stay.

25:07.260 --> 25:10.060
Good that you are not going now.

25:10.580 --> 25:12.140
Having you by my side is everything.

25:12.640 --> 25:16.040
Haven't I always taken you
to the best places?

25:18.160 --> 25:19.160
And did you

25:19.720 --> 25:20.800
read my texts?

25:21.340 --> 25:23.500
Do you know how well I did
on the college entrance exam?

25:24.660 --> 25:25.560
I know.

25:27.700 --> 25:28.900
Northern Normal University, right?

25:30.140 --> 25:31.780
Never imagined you'd score that well.

25:33.120 --> 25:33.960
Well…

25:35.060 --> 25:36.640
with your Olympiad results,

25:37.140 --> 25:40.160
you could've waltzed into
any top university in Hongyang.

25:40.720 --> 25:41.720
And you know

25:41.760 --> 25:44.980
all the best ones are just a stone's throw
from Northern Normal University.

25:46.840 --> 25:47.780
I know.

25:48.580 --> 25:49.620
And I…

25:50.840 --> 25:54.220
I'll pick the campus closest to yours.

25:55.560 --> 25:56.780
That way,

25:56.820 --> 25:58.660
we can walk to class together…

26:00.840 --> 26:02.180
queue at the same canteen,

26:03.360 --> 26:05.520
and just…

26:06.160 --> 26:07.460
be together.

26:11.320 --> 26:12.420
What you said…

26:14.700 --> 26:15.680
Is it real?

26:16.500 --> 26:17.760
We could really be…

26:18.780 --> 26:20.480
together every day?

26:21.840 --> 26:24.320
Of course. When have I ever lied to you?

26:28.320 --> 26:29.160
You're right.

26:31.460 --> 26:32.660
You've always achieved everything

26:33.160 --> 26:34.000
you set your mind to.

26:39.940 --> 26:41.400
But…

26:42.880 --> 26:44.700
when you said it, why do you sound like

26:45.240 --> 26:46.600
you're holding back tears?

26:50.260 --> 26:51.240
No.

26:52.240 --> 26:53.300
It's just…

26:54.180 --> 26:55.320
it's just that…

26:57.900 --> 26:59.100
when I imagine

26:59.880 --> 27:01.460
our future together so bright,

27:02.740 --> 27:04.080
this happiness feels unbearable.

27:11.340 --> 27:12.840
Then I want proof.

27:14.800 --> 27:16.020
What proof?

27:42.060 --> 27:43.280
Do you have little fang teeth?

28:56.980 --> 28:57.820
Yingtao.

29:03.600 --> 29:04.700
Don't forget me.

29:22.020 --> 29:22.860
Yingtao.

29:24.020 --> 29:25.300
I want to eat

29:26.260 --> 29:27.660
jujube buns made by Auntie.

29:28.300 --> 29:29.840
You're so lucky.

29:30.340 --> 29:31.560
My mom made

29:32.060 --> 29:33.360
a lot today.

29:35.540 --> 29:37.580
Then let's go back to eat.

29:38.380 --> 29:39.220
Okay.

29:40.140 --> 29:40.980
Let's go.

29:57.700 --> 29:58.660
Jiang Qiaoxi.

29:59.020 --> 29:59.860
‪Yes?

30:02.420 --> 30:03.460
Jiang Qiaoxi.

30:09.980 --> 30:12.800
Jiang Qiaoxi.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.320
Jiang Qiaoxi.

30:22.380 --> 30:23.720
When our future arrives…

30:24.240 --> 30:27.360
when we're truly together every day,

30:28.340 --> 30:30.460
could you wear…

30:30.960 --> 30:31.980
brighter colors?

30:32.020 --> 30:34.580
No more of these muted grays. Please?

30:35.440 --> 30:38.640
Every time you dress in sunlight hues,

30:38.680 --> 30:41.180
it's like watching joy made visible.

30:42.020 --> 30:43.340
I think you feel it too.

30:44.520 --> 30:46.300
I don't look good in brighter colors.

30:46.800 --> 30:48.360
Good-looking.

30:48.400 --> 30:49.340
Good-looking!

30:51.100 --> 30:53.020
Okay, I'll wear it later.

31:02.700 --> 31:04.900
Jiang Qiaoxi.

31:05.720 --> 31:07.640
Jiang Qiaoxi.

31:08.560 --> 31:10.420
Jiang Qiaoxi.

31:17.200 --> 31:18.040
- Yingtao.
- Hm?

31:21.640 --> 31:23.960
Don't you think I'm missing something?

31:29.660 --> 31:30.640
What's missing?

31:32.680 --> 31:33.840
My suitcase.

31:37.480 --> 31:38.320
Right.

31:38.960 --> 31:41.440
Where is the suitcase?

31:43.680 --> 31:45.020
It's probably at my doorstep.

31:45.660 --> 31:48.400
Hope no one's taken it.

31:56.180 --> 31:57.820
Look, here's the plan:

31:57.860 --> 31:59.740
you go up first
and start steaming the buns.

31:59.780 --> 32:01.100
I'll dash back for the suitcase.

32:01.140 --> 32:02.840
I'll be back just as they're ready to eat.

32:07.820 --> 32:08.960
Okay.

32:10.060 --> 32:10.900
Go.

32:18.000 --> 32:19.000
Jiang Qiaoxi.

32:19.620 --> 32:22.180
When we see my parents upstairs,

32:22.840 --> 32:24.340
you tell them…

32:25.660 --> 32:26.720
we met on the way here.

32:27.460 --> 32:29.500
And I'm warning you,
not a single word out of line.

32:30.480 --> 32:32.380
Sure. I won't.

32:44.640 --> 32:45.640
Jiang Qiaoxi.

32:52.120 --> 32:53.200
What is it?

32:55.720 --> 32:56.980
I like you.

32:59.340 --> 33:00.900
I like you very much.

33:09.400 --> 33:10.520
I know.

33:18.640 --> 33:19.480
I love you.

33:35.400 --> 33:36.620
Go back.

34:01.100 --> 34:02.040
Who's there?

34:02.720 --> 34:03.580
Who's there?

34:04.560 --> 34:05.760
Me.

34:06.260 --> 34:08.000
Didn't you bring the key?

34:08.040 --> 34:09.199
I forgot.

34:12.400 --> 34:13.340
What are you doing?

34:13.380 --> 34:15.400
I'll warm up the jujube buns.

34:15.440 --> 34:16.800
Jiang Qiaoxi's hungry. He's craving them.

34:17.800 --> 34:18.960
- Qiaoxi?
- Yes.

34:20.100 --> 34:21.260
Qiaoxi's back?

34:22.780 --> 34:24.060
I…

34:24.100 --> 34:27.760
I was passing his place
when I just happened to see

34:28.260 --> 34:29.460
him step out.

34:29.500 --> 34:31.500
He's gone back to grab his luggage now.

34:32.000 --> 34:33.179
He'll be right over.

34:35.500 --> 34:37.679
That's not how you steam buns.
Here, let me.

34:39.100 --> 34:40.340
Just go wait over there.

34:52.760 --> 34:53.679
What are you doing?

34:53.719 --> 34:55.280
- Stuffed lotus roots.
- Don't turn it on.

34:56.219 --> 34:57.160
Later,

34:57.700 --> 34:59.640
Mom will fry them properly in the pan.

35:04.180 --> 35:05.340
Stop pouring like that.

35:05.380 --> 35:07.400
Just leave it. I'll handle it.

35:08.040 --> 35:08.880
Fine.

35:32.040 --> 35:33.240
What are you doing, Yingtao?

35:34.700 --> 35:35.580
I…

35:36.080 --> 35:37.760
I was wondering why he hadn't come yet.

35:38.260 --> 35:39.100
Who?

35:40.360 --> 35:41.200
Jiang Qiaoxi.

36:06.800 --> 36:07.740
Hello.

36:07.780 --> 36:10.980
The subscriber you have dialed
is currently unavailable.

36:11.020 --> 36:12.460
Please try your call again later.

36:25.760 --> 36:26.680
Hello.

36:26.720 --> 36:29.820
The subscriber you have dialed
is currently unavailable.

36:29.860 --> 36:31.340
Please try your call again later.

36:37.740 --> 36:38.580
Where are you going?

36:38.620 --> 36:39.900
You just got back. Heading out again?

36:39.940 --> 36:40.920
Yingtao!

36:41.420 --> 36:42.260
Yingtao!

36:44.960 --> 36:45.800
Yingtao!

37:18.700 --> 37:19.960
Jiang Qiaoxi!

37:53.980 --> 37:55.000
Uncle!

37:55.040 --> 37:57.460
Uncle, have you seen
a boy in black clothes,

37:57.500 --> 37:59.300
wearing a hat, and pulling a suitcase?

37:59.340 --> 38:01.560
He caught a taxi right outside,

38:01.600 --> 38:02.620
headed that way.

38:02.660 --> 38:03.500
Thanks!

38:05.960 --> 38:07.360
Jiang Qiaoxi!

38:17.480 --> 38:18.920
Jiang Qiaoxi!

38:43.580 --> 38:45.020
Jiang Qiaoxi!

39:08.080 --> 39:09.960
Jiang Qiaoxi!

39:16.740 --> 39:18.080
- Yingtao!
- Yingtao!

39:18.580 --> 39:19.440
Yingtao!

39:22.480 --> 39:23.320
Yingtao!

39:25.500 --> 39:26.700
Yingtao!

39:31.020 --> 39:31.860
Yingtao.

39:32.620 --> 39:33.460
Yingtao.

39:33.500 --> 39:34.380
You…

39:36.300 --> 39:37.180
What happened?

39:43.460 --> 39:44.940
Jiang Qixoi…

39:46.000 --> 39:47.300
Jiang Qixoi,

39:48.040 --> 39:49.940
he lied to me.

39:57.040 --> 39:59.080
Le't get up. We're going home.

40:00.320 --> 40:01.160
Let's go.

40:02.140 --> 40:02.980
Let's go.

40:04.180 --> 40:06.220
He lied to me.

40:06.860 --> 40:07.780
We'll talk back home.

40:11.680 --> 40:12.820
Go!

40:12.860 --> 40:15.120
Jiang Qiaoxi will call me.

40:18.220 --> 40:19.320
Let's back home.

40:29.060 --> 40:30.020
Let's be back.

40:39.360 --> 40:40.720
In 2008,

40:40.760 --> 40:45.360
a financial crisis triggered
by American subprime mortgage market

40:45.400 --> 40:47.660
swept across global financial markets

40:47.700 --> 40:49.720
like a sudden tsunami.

40:49.760 --> 40:51.180
A devastating blow to the world economy…

40:51.220 --> 40:53.480
They say it is the most
severe economic crisis

40:53.520 --> 40:55.500
since the Great Depression of 1929.

40:55.540 --> 40:57.600
And now, just as our child starts college,

40:57.640 --> 40:58.980
at the beginning of their adult life,

40:59.020 --> 41:01.020
they have to face
such tremendous upheaval.

41:02.880 --> 41:05.080
A generation's fate and challenges.

41:05.120 --> 41:06.800
Let the kids forge their own path.

41:07.500 --> 41:09.320
What is with this year?

41:09.820 --> 41:12.520
Natural disasters, economic crises.

41:13.020 --> 41:14.620
Everyone's tightening their belts.

41:15.220 --> 41:17.660
Even my mart's feeling the pinch.

41:18.220 --> 41:19.240
Don't worry, Qin.

41:19.780 --> 41:20.860
The country is boosting domestic demands.

41:21.360 --> 41:23.000
Haven't you heard?
They are adjusting the interest rates.

41:23.040 --> 41:24.340
Once investments start flowing in,

41:24.380 --> 41:26.960
- the economy will bounce back in no time.
- Exactly!

41:28.880 --> 41:29.860
Great!

41:31.860 --> 41:33.620
This carp shape is spot-on!

41:33.660 --> 41:36.100
You've really captured that energy
of triumphant leap to success

41:37.500 --> 41:38.900
I've learnt this dish ages ago.

41:38.940 --> 41:42.040
I am saving it for today,
for when the kids got into college.

41:42.080 --> 41:42.960
Now, let me show you.

41:43.460 --> 41:44.600
Amazing you!

41:45.140 --> 41:47.420
I still see them as little kids,

41:47.460 --> 41:49.180
and now poof,
they're already college students.

41:50.140 --> 41:52.820
When Yingtao was little,
she hated studying,

41:52.860 --> 41:54.440
always off playing somewhere.

41:54.480 --> 41:55.980
Back then, I was thinking,

41:56.020 --> 41:58.800
will this kid even make it to college?

41:58.840 --> 42:00.680
No need to worry now.

42:00.720 --> 42:03.840
Yingtao scored the highest
of all the kids.

42:03.880 --> 42:05.900
Even a solid dozen points
above our Yu Qiao.

42:07.520 --> 42:08.360
And Du Shang,

42:08.400 --> 42:10.140
remember that tiny kid

42:10.180 --> 42:11.680
always practicing martial arts?

42:12.180 --> 42:13.960
Now he's gotten into medical school.

42:14.500 --> 42:16.140
Future doctor right there.

42:16.180 --> 42:18.680
With his personality, perfect for the job.

42:19.220 --> 42:20.620
When I need check-ups later,

42:20.660 --> 42:22.160
I'm booking him, no second thoughts.

42:23.040 --> 42:24.580
Enough about illnesses.

42:24.620 --> 42:26.420
Let's focus on the good stuff.

42:26.460 --> 42:29.100
Just imagine us someday
flying together on Yu Qiao's plane.

42:29.680 --> 42:33.020
Northern Aviation University,
that's insanely competitive,

42:33.060 --> 42:34.340
yet he got in like it was nothing.

42:35.160 --> 42:36.540
All our kids

42:36.580 --> 42:37.680
are making us proud.

42:37.720 --> 42:38.560
Exactly!

42:39.260 --> 42:41.440
Hasn't your Fangyuan
already made it as a boss?

42:41.480 --> 42:44.320
Get this. Yesterday,
his dad and I took him shopping

42:44.360 --> 42:46.200
for school supplies, but guess what?

42:46.740 --> 42:47.880
The young man turned the tables

42:47.920 --> 42:49.020
and used his own money

42:49.060 --> 42:51.360
to buy us new outfits instead.

42:51.400 --> 42:52.640
Really?

42:53.200 --> 42:54.240
Nice.

42:54.940 --> 42:56.220
And to think you used to

42:56.260 --> 42:58.980
complain Fangyuan drove you crazy,
remember?

42:59.020 --> 43:00.180
Well, look at him now,

43:00.920 --> 43:02.060
built his own internet empire

43:02.100 --> 43:04.180
with such a big success.

43:04.680 --> 43:05.720
Right!

43:05.760 --> 43:07.240
Your Fangyuan's killing it. What a star!

43:07.280 --> 43:08.120
Exactly.

43:08.160 --> 43:10.760
Sure, he's no natural at studying.

43:11.260 --> 43:13.620
But he got into a decent university
in Shanghai.

43:14.120 --> 43:15.400
That's more than enough for me.

43:15.440 --> 43:16.920
Plus, he got to keep Du Shang as buddies.

43:18.880 --> 43:21.900
At least Yingtao and Yu Qiao
can look out for each other in Hongyang.

43:22.700 --> 43:25.460
But Yunyun? She could've gone too,

43:25.500 --> 43:26.860
yet chose to stay home alone.

43:27.400 --> 43:29.880
That girl's got a good heart.
She just wants to stay close to her dad.

43:31.600 --> 43:33.520
Daughters really are the best,
so thoughtful.

43:34.020 --> 43:34.920
Not like sons.

43:35.420 --> 43:36.820
Our Cai Fangyuan,

43:36.860 --> 43:39.280
even talking in his sleep,
he's begging to go to Shanghai.

43:40.120 --> 43:40.960
Juan,

43:41.760 --> 43:43.700
how's Yingtao been lately?

43:45.840 --> 43:47.380
She seems fine on the surface,

43:47.880 --> 43:50.400
but who knows what's brewing beneath?

43:51.080 --> 43:52.760
Yesterday she insisted on

43:52.800 --> 43:56.220
going to Hongyang alone, wouldn't even
let me or her dad see her off.

43:56.720 --> 43:58.900
Really makes you wonder
what's going on in that head of hers.

44:00.820 --> 44:03.140
This doesn't sound like Yingtao at all.

46:30.660 --> 46:33.160
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
